Original commit body from 42b7102:

When the number of symbols is large (e.g., 29,036 for TensorFlow),
passing the combined regex pattern on the command line exceeds the
kernel's argument list size limit (E2BIG / Errno 7).

The fix writes the pattern to a temporary file and uses ripgrep's
-f flag to read the pattern from the file. A finally block ensures
the temp file is always cleaned up.
